# Card Database (DBV), card tables, and deck editor table CSS

- **database-view.css**: Card database view shell (`#database-view`) — tabs, stats, layout, shared DB chrome. Not deck editor Card View.
- **card-tables.css**: Card database **tables** only — column widths, header filters, checkbox filter chrome. Not deck editor Card View.
- **deck-editor-card-view.css**: Deck editor **Card View** only (`.deck-cards-editor.card-view`). Loaded after `card-tables.css`, before `mobile-layout.css`. Do not conflate with deck selection tiles (different CSS).
- **Card View** (`.deck-cards-editor.card-view`): Each card is a `.deck-card-card-view-item` with `data-type` and `data-orientation`. **Orientation rule:** only character, location, and event are landscape; all other types are portrait. **Do not regress:** see [docs/current/DECK_EDITOR_CARD_VIEW_LAYOUT.md](../../docs/current/DECK_EDITOR_CARD_VIEW_LAYOUT.md).
  - **Landscape** (character, location, event) — **reusable layout:** Card item and `.card-foil-img-wrap` have **no visible frame** (border: none, background: transparent, outline: none, box-shadow: none). Image fills wrap edge-to-edge with **bevelled corners** (border-radius: 8px on wrap and images). `.card-view-actions` in flow **below** the image with padding. Same CSS block for all three; only wrap height differs by type. Do not add border/background to item or wrap.
  - **Portrait** (mission, special, aspect, power, etc.): Image fills frame; `.card-view-actions` **below** the frame (`position: absolute`, `bottom: -35px`).
- Exact dimensions and breakpoints: [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) (Deck Editor Card View Styling).
- **Two-layer progressive load** (card-view and hover modal): Thumb + full-res are stacked; full-res fades in via `--loaded` class. [docs/current/PROGRESSIVE_IMAGE_LOADING.md](../../docs/current/PROGRESSIVE_IMAGE_LOADING.md).
- **Character Stacks Available Cards styles**:
  - Uses existing available-cards category/group styles in `index.css`: `.card-category`, `.character-group`, `.character-group-header`, `.character-group-content`, `.add-all-btn`.
  - Character Stacks subdivision search input uses `.character-stack-name-search` and intentionally matches `.character-name-search` styling.
  - Keep shared selector parity between `.character-name-search` and `.character-stack-name-search` to avoid UI drift.
  - Reference: [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) section "Deck Editor Available Cards Character Stacks".
- **Database View Special Cards columns (Icon, Value, Function)**:
  - Column order and widths (all in `database-view.css` `nth-child` rules): `14% | 9% | 15% | 13% | 21% | 8%(Icon) | 8%(Value) | 12%(Function)`.
  - **Icon column** styles:
    - Cell grid: `.special-power-icons-cell` — `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 20px); gap: 4px; justify-content: center`.
    - Cell icon: `.special-power-type-icon` — fixed `20px × 20px`.
    - Text fallback: `.special-icon-text-fallback` — for icons without a PNG (e.g. Multi-Power).
    - Filter toggle grid: `.special-power-filter-toggles` — `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 36px); gap: 6px`.
    - Toggle button: `.power-type-filter-toggle` — same `36px` square style as `.function-filter-toggle`; active: `.is-active`; disabled: `.is-disabled`.
    - "No Icon" (Special Cards): `.special-no-icon-toggle-label` + hidden `#special-no-icon-toggle` + `.special-no-icon-toggle-face` / `.special-no-icon-svg` (ban icon), same square toggle chrome as `.power-type-filter-toggle` (Aspects table still uses checkbox + text).
    - Outer wrapper: `.icon-filter-container` — `display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px`.
    - **Value filter** UI: `.column-filters` + `.filter-input.equals/.min/.max`. **No value** ban: `.special-no-value-toggle-label` + hidden checkbox + `.special-no-value-toggle-face` / `.special-no-value-svg`. **Special Cards:** `#special-no-value-toggle`. **Aspects:** `#aspect-no-value-toggle` with the same face/SVG classes; **`#aspects-table`** rules in `database-view.css` mirror Special button chrome on desktop. Disabled state: `#special-cards-table .filter-input:disabled`.
  - **Function column** styles: `.special-function-filter-toggles` (2-col grid), `.function-filter-toggle` (36px square), `.special-function-icon` (32px).
  - Update [docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md](../../docs/current/STYLE_GUIDE.md) whenever any of these column/toggle visuals change.

## Mobile / `layout-mobile`

- **Roadmap and milestones:** [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) (repo root). Breakpoint source of truth: **`--layout-mobile-max`** in `mobile-layout.css` (keep aligned with `layout-mode.js`). **DBV Characters + Special Cards** CSS regressions: [`tests/unit/layout-mode-and-viewport.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/layout-mode-and-viewport.test.ts) (`describe` **`mobile-layout.css (DBV Characters tab)`** and **`mobile-layout.css (DBV Special Cards tab)`**); comments in `mobile-layout.css` by **`--dbv-mobile-tile-*`**, **Special Cards tab**, and Characters **M2c** header point there. **DBV Aspects tab (mobile):** [`tests/unit/dbv-aspects-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-aspects-mobile.test.ts); how it looks: [`docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md); **`mobile-layout.css`** block comment above **Aspects tab**. **DBV Missions tab (mobile):** [`tests/unit/dbv-missions-mobile.test.ts`](../../tests/unit/dbv-missions-mobile.test.ts); how it looks: [`docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md); **`mobile-layout.css`** block comment **Missions tab — mobile filter shell**. **Sizing still wrong in QA?** See [`docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_CARD_IMAGE_TRIES.md`](../../docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_CARD_IMAGE_TRIES.md) (what we tried: row art tokens, `#imageModal`).
- **Critical: `td img { max-height: 180px !important }` override.** `database-view.css` has a broad desktop rule that caps ALL table images to 180px height. **Every mobile DBV tab** must add `max-height: none !important` to its portrait `img` rules (both `.layout-mobile` and `@media (max-width: 900px)` mirror). Without this, images appear tiny despite correct width. Full repeatable pattern with checklist: [`docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_TD_IMG_MAX_HEIGHT_FIX.md`](../../docs/current/MOBILE_DBV_TD_IMG_MAX_HEIGHT_FIX.md).
- **Scope mobile-specific rules** under **`html.layout-mobile`** (or `.layout-mobile` descendant of `html` with class on root) in [`public/css/mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css). Avoid widening desktop tables for mobile—prefer stacked filters, scroll wrappers, or card-row patterns per `MOBILE_DESIGN.md`.
- **Global nav (M1 + refinements):** Under **`.layout-mobile`**, **`mobile-layout.css`** defines a **row** header (logo + **`.header-nav-cluster`**), **2×2** **`.header-app-actions`** grid, **`.user-menu-toggle`** **`flex-end`**, **half-width** account dropdown, logo column sizing, and **no top padding** on **`.unified-header`**. Desktop: **`.header-nav-cluster`** is **`display: contents`** in **`globalNav.css`**. Spec: [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) **§10.1**; agent detail: [`public/components/.cursorrules`](../components/.cursorrules).
- **Touch targets:** Prefer **44px** minimum; utility class **`.touch-target-min`** in `mobile-layout.css` where individual controls are undersized.
- **DBV files:** `database-view.css`, `card-tables.css`; deck Card View: `deck-editor-card-view.css`. **M2c (done):** mobile DBV rules and Characters **card rows** in [`mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css); **`#characters-table tbody td:nth-child(n+3)`** hidden under **`.layout-mobile`** (name/stats — image + actions only). **`.layout-mobile #database-view`** sets **`container-type: inline-size`**, **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-max: 100%`**, **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-landscape-max-h: min(56cqw, 480px)`**, and **`--dbv-mobile-table-portrait-img*`** as **`%`** of the flex row (not **`100vw`**) so art fits the padded shell; **`#characters-table`** uses **`table-layout: auto !important`** on mobile. Overrides **All** tab **`.all-cards-cell`** image caps (desktop **`database-view.css`** stays **`200px`**). **All-tab** **`img.horizontal-card`**: **`width: 100%`** + **`max-height: none`** (same width as portrait tiles); **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-landscape-max-h`** applies to **Characters** (and similar) **`tbody`** art, not the All grid. **`.characters-mobile-card-caption`** (mobile-only) under character art — **`.characters-mobile-card-caption__name`**, optional **`__ability`** (**`special_abilities`**), then **`__set`** (set / number). Character **`.card-image-container`**: mobile **flex** row (**prev | img | next**), **`width: 100%`**; **`img`** uses the same **`--dbv-mobile-tile-img-max`**, **`horizontal-card`** + landscape **`max-height`** token via **`applyDbvHorizontalCardClass`** in [`card-display.js`](../js/card-display.js); portrait **`max-height: none !important`** overrides **`td img`**; **`--with-nav`** still on DOM when alternate art exists. Character **`data-label`** + row height locks in **`card-display.js`**. Roadmap: `MOBILE_DESIGN.md`.
- **Characters filter row (mobile):** **`tr.characters-filter-row`** unified card (**`1fr`** grid). **`th.characters-filter-clear-th`** hidden; **`#clear-filters-mobile`** in **`.characters-filter-clear-inline`** (**right** of **`= / Min / Max`**; panels **`flex: 3`**, clear **`flex: 1`**). **Search abilities** **`th`** full width (same as name). **`characters-filter-spacer-th`** hidden. **Inherent** toggles hidden.
- **Special Cards filter + rows (mobile):** **`#special-cards-table thead`** **`display: block`**, **`tr.special-cards-filter-row`** **row** flex + **wrap** + **`justify-content: center`**; **two full-width rows:** function toggles (**`order: 1`**), then type + No Icon (**`order: 2`**), both centered (**`justify-content: center`** on toggle strips); **character / name / effect / value** **`th`** use **`flex: 1 1 100%`** and **`width/max-width: 100% !important`** to override **`database-view.css`** **`th:nth-child(n) { width: … !important }`** — otherwise filters collapse to a left rail. **`order`**: function row (**toggles** + **`|`** + **`#clear-special-filters-mobile`**) → type + No Icon → value row → character → name → effect; **`.special-value-inputs-and-clear`**: **no** horizontal **padding** (edges match **`.header-filter`**); **value** **`.column-filters`**: **CSS Grid** **`4fr 85fr 4fr 125fr 4fr 125fr 4fr 45fr 4fr`** (**1%** gutters; **21.25/31.25/31.25/11.25%** controls; items cols **2,4,6,8**); **Clear** is on function row. Filter-row **`.header-filter`**: **`100% !important`** (beats **`card-tables.css`** **85%** centering on mobile). **`thead tr:first-child`** visually hidden; **`#clear-special-filters-desktop`** hidden on mobile. **Tbody:** card rows, hidden **`td:nth-child(n+3)`**, **Special** caption stack (**`__name`**, **`__character`**, **`__ability`** = plain effect, optional **`__opd`** / **`__cataclysm`** / **`__assist`** / **`__ambush`**, **`__set`**), **44px** nav. **Desktop:** **`#special-cards-table .special-function-mobile-trailing { display: none }`** in **`database-view.css`**.
- **Aspects filter + rows (mobile):** **`#aspects-table`** — same **value grid** and **card-row tbody** idea as Special, **no** function-icon row. **`tr.aspects-filter-row`**: icon row (**power toggles + No Icon**) with **`#clear-aspects-filters-mobile`** in **`.aspect-icon-mobile-trailing`** (**`margin-left: auto`**); then value → location → name → effect (**`order`** **1–5**). **Desktop:** **`.aspect-icon-mobile-trailing { display: none }`** in **`database-view.css`**. **Caption** under art + **no `data-label`** on actions **`td`**: **`displayAspects`** in **`card-display-functions.js`**. Full spec: [`docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md); tests: **`dbv-aspects-mobile.test.ts`**.
- **Missions filter + rows (mobile):** **`#missions-table`** — **`tr.missions-filter-row`** teal shell; **mobile** **`.missions-mobile-set-label`** (**`#4ecdc4`**) + **`#missions-mission-set-filter`** full width; **checkboxes** hidden; **`.missions-filter-clear-th`** hidden (**no** tab Clear). **Desktop:** **`#missions-table .missions-mobile-set-row { display: none }`** in **`database-view.css`**. **Tbody** card rows + **`--dbv-mobile-missions-*`** + caption (JS). Spec: [`docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md); tests: **`dbv-missions-mobile.test.ts`**.
- **Training tab (mobile):** **`#training-table`** — Ally-style **`tr.training-filter-row`** + **`.training-stat-type-toggles`**; filters **`type_1` / `type_2`** via **`applyTrainingFilters`** (`search-filter-functions.js`). **Tbody** card rows + **`--dbv-mobile-training-*`** + **`characters-mobile-card-caption--training`**. **Desktop:** mobile shell hidden in **`database-view.css`**. Spec: [`docs/current/DBV_TRAINING_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_TRAINING_MOBILE.md); tests: **`dbv-training-mobile.test.ts`**.
- **Universe: Basic tab (mobile):** **`#basic-universe-table`** — desktop **`basic-universe-desktop-filter-row`**; mobile **`basic-universe-filter-row`** (Training-style **`basic-universe-stat-type-toggles`**) + two Teamwork-style value strips (**To Use** / **Bonus**). **`applyBasicUniverseFilters`** + **`window.basicUniverseData`** (`card-filter-toggles.js`); **`displayBasicUniverse`** / **`buildBasicUniverseMobileCaptionHtml`** / **`setupBasicUniverseSearch`** (`card-data-display.js`). **Desktop:** mobile shell hidden in **`database-view.css`**. Spec: [`docs/current/DBV_BASIC_UNIVERSE_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/DBV_BASIC_UNIVERSE_MOBILE.md); tests: **`dbv-basic-universe-mobile.test.ts`**.
- **Events filter + rows (mobile):** **`#events-table`** — **`tr.events-filter-row`** (same shell pattern as Missions) + **`#events-mission-set-filter`** + full-width **`game_effect`** **`.header-filter`**; **`.events-checkbox-group`** hidden on mobile; desktop Clear hidden; **`#clear-events-filters-mobile`** on mobile. **Tbody** mirrors **Locations** (**`--dbv-mobile-table-portrait-img`**, no nav). **Caption:** **`__name`**, **`__set`**, **`__game-effect`**, **`__flavor`** (italic). **Desktop:** **`#events-table .events-mobile-set-row { display: none }`**. **`@media (max-width: 900px) #database-view #events-table`** mirror. Tests: **`dbv-events-mobile.test.ts`**.
- **Characters tab stat filters:** Markup uses **`th.characters-stat-filters-th`** **`colspan="5"`** with **`.characters-stat-tablist`** (icon tabs) + **`.characters-stat-panels`** / **`.characters-stat-panel`** / **`.column-filters`**. **Desktop** (`html:not(.layout-mobile)` in `database-view.css`): tablist hidden; panels row with five vertical `.column-filters`. **Mobile** (`mobile-layout.css`): **file-folder** tabs; active **`.column-filters`** row: **`.equals`**, **`.min`**, **`.max`** all **`flex: 1 1 0`** (equal width). **`characters-stat-filter-tabs.js`**: tab clicks + `layout-mode-change`. Filter: **`card-filter-toggles.js`** `applyFilters`.
